4,Jukun Takum language - globalrecordings.net,https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/jbu,"Words of Life (in Jukun: Takum) Short audio Bible stories and evangelistic messages that explain salvation and give basic Christian teaching. Each program is a customised and culturally relevant selection of scripts, and may include songs and music.",Jukun Takum,Niger-Congo
5,Jukun Takum language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/jukun_takum_language,"The Jukun Takum language, a dialect of the Jukunoid group within the Benue-Congo branch of Niger-Congo, traces its origins to the migrations associated with the ancient Kwararafa kingdom, a multiethnic confederation in the Benue River valley.",Jukun Takum,Niger-Congo
